					<br><br><div class="largetext">The responses of the Reporting Person to Rows (5) through (9) of the cover page of this Schedule 13G are incorporated herein by reference. As of December 31, 2024, the Reporting Person has sole voting power with respect to the 23,027 shares of Class A Common Stock as follows: (i) 8,065 shares of Class A Common Stock issuable pursuant to options held by the Reporting Person that are exercisable on, or within 60 days following, December 31, 2024 and(ii) 14,962 stock units, held directly, such shares will be paid out in shares of Class A Common Stock on the first business day of January 2025.</div><br></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">(ii) Shared power to vote or to direct the vote:
